{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>北角電氣道對開有兩車相撞。今日（20日）上午，一輛貨車懷疑在電氣道切線時，意外撞倒一輛停泊在路旁的七人車。網上影片可見，七人車車尾盡毀，車窗碎裂剝落，玻璃碎散落一地；貨車左邊車頭亦有撞凹。</p><p>警方於上午10時12分接獲報案，指一名55歲姓黃男子駕駛貨車沿電氣道東行，當駛至電氣道180號對開切線時，意外撞向一輛停泊路旁的七人車。事故中，35歲姓呂七人車司機並無受傷。</p><figure><img alt=\"七人車車尾盡毀。（Hong Kong Discover Delight 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167115502976634880427081.png/q1T06BqG1-SSPJpqIno_86g9yrFK7JUxPDyvqDw8r6g\"/><figcaption>七人車車尾盡毀。（Hong Kong Discover Delight 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"七人車車尾盡毀。（Hong Kong Discover Delight 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167115500887740416107254.png/SwHCSpGHUftMMM0XrpXyJOsmEyajiFj7kW5zhJFuc4Q\"/><figcaption>七人車車尾盡毀。（Hong Kong Discover Delight 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車左邊車頭亦有撞凹。（Hong Kong Discover Delight 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167115988500484096716230.png/oJe22UwVpK5g5Hydf4-JTpwI0Snotj0G-YtbV_mLW1c\"/><figcaption>貨車左邊車頭亦有撞凹。（Hong Kong Discover Delight 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"碎片散落一地。（Hong Kong Discover Delight 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167115496697368576089716.png/NpOXg77-ANnDYFJ7cZEFPoL-3rRKWHaczvkN-M75Dfg\"/><figcaption>碎片散落一地。（Hong Kong Discover Delight 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車撞倒停泊在路旁的七人車。（Hong Kong Discover Delight 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167115498798845952278096.png/xoWG89_nPiHJSK2g2v7HtZXL03sOeIbEKY3pNimN6TY\"/><figcaption>貨車撞倒停泊在路旁的七人車。（Hong Kong Discover Delight 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T06:59:24.989300+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":400,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}